  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Hello! I am Tom. Look at the picture. It is a morning at my house. This is my shirt, and it is white. These are my shorts. They are blue. Here is a shoe. Pip has my shoe too! Lily has a skirt for school. Her skirt is blue too. Mom says, \"Come and eat rice.\" Then Lily and I walk to school.",
      "Look at my school bag. It has a pencil and a ruler. It has an eraser, too. The eraser is small and white. The ruler is long and the pencil is short. I draw with my pencil at school. I like my school things.",
      "Now look at the picture of my bag. Is a pencil in the bag? Make a tick. Is a cat in the bag? Make a cross. Is a ruler in the bag? Make a tick. Is a shoe in the bag? Make a cross."
    ],
    "summary": "Tom shows his school clothes and the things in his school bag. At the end, you tick the things in the bag and cross the other things.",
